From bde0cca82c6c652a6115dd6e626a855084da2cb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:57:18 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the file list shows each cup's trophy, five to a page,
 L and R turn the page

SaveFileSummary.cups[4] (a count per tier) becomes cupBits[4], a bitmask of the
cleared cups (bit n is cup n; 32 cups fit; same size). The file list draws the
cups' own trophy sprites (the lobby ones), five to a page, a cup not yet won in
grey (Sprite_SetAnimationColorModesFar), and under them a page indicator "1/2"
in the native number font. L and R turn the page (up and down reset it). The
fifth sprite slot lives in the unused first Djinn-menu figure phase of the menu
work. The Continue list and the Pause-menu Save list share the code. New saves
only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
