 /// The file list shows the chosen file's party as walking sprites in a
-/// row, and four trophy sprites, one for each tier of cups, over the file's cup
-/// counts. Each sprite stands three tiles (24 pixels) from the one before.
+/// row, and below it the file's cup trophies, a page of them at a time (L and R
